    <briefdescription>
<para>Peruvian inti. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The ISO three-letter code was PEI. It was divided in 100 centimos. A numeric code is not available; as per ISO 3166-1, we assign 998 as a user-defined code.</para><para>Obsoleted by the nuevo sol since July 1991. </para>    </detaileddescription>
